WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.571
Typography decides whether people read your message, or skip it.

00:00:04.420 --> 00:00:06.479
Use one or two fonts at most.

00:00:07.030 --> 00:00:12.897
Make a clear size hierarchy: headline biggest, then subheadings, then body text.

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:16.077
Avoid whole paragraphs in capital letters.

00:00:16.630 --> 00:00:21.858
Use simple fonts for long text, and decorative fonts only for short titles.

00:00:22.410 --> 00:00:32.046
Before you move on, check: Use at most two fonts. Set a clear headline, subheading and body size. Check text is readable on a phone.

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:35.694
In the next lesson: Layout and hierarchy.
